# Pay-to-Rank Advertising Leaderboard with Plinko Game

A real-time, outbid.lol-inspired advertising leaderboard where users bid for rank positions. Bids pass through a Plinko multiplier game that amplifies (or reduces) the base bid before placement.

## User Choices

| Decision | Choice |
|----------|--------|
| CSS Framework | **Tailwind CSS v4** (CSS-first config) |
| Database & Real-time | **Firebase** (Firestore + Realtime features) |
| Payments | **Stripe** (real payment processing) |

