### 10. API Routes Summary

| Route | Method | Purpose |
|-------|--------|---------|
| `/api/ads` | `GET` | Fetch leaderboard (sorted by finalBid desc) |
| `/api/ads` | `POST` | Submit new ad after payment + Plinko |
| `/api/ads/[id]/approve` | `PATCH` | Admin: approve a pending ad |
| `/api/ads/[id]/reject` | `PATCH` | Admin: reject a pending ad |
| `/api/create-payment-intent` | `POST` | Create Stripe PaymentIntent |
| `/api/webhooks/stripe` | `POST` | Stripe webhook handler |
| `/api/plinko` | `POST` | Generate server-side multiplier |
| `/api/track-click` | `POST` | Increment click count + redirect |
| `/api/admin/stats` | `GET` | Admin analytics data |

