## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Auto-approve or manual review?** Should new ads go live immediately after payment, or require admin approval first? I'm defaulting to **auto-approve** for frictionless UX but can add a review queue.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Bid expiration?** Should bids expire after a time period (e.g., 30 days), or persist indefinitely? Outbid.lol seems to persist them. I'll default to **no expiration**.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Rebidding?** Can an advertiser re-bid to increase their rank, or is each bid a separate entry? I'll default to **each bid is a separate entry** (simpler), but can support re-bidding on existing entries.

